# Pairs with TypeOK. A participant records a vote outside the vote domain.
MODULE: TypeOkVoteRunaway
TARGET: TypeOK
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: a participant's vote takes a value outside its declared domain
PERTURBS: Build

--- FIND
    /\ \E v \in {"yes", "no"} :
--- REPLACE
    \* MUTATION: an undeclared vote value.
    /\ \E v \in {"yes", "no", "maybe"} :
--- END
